      "deltaSummaryMarkdown": "Inspected the wording-only delta in `docs/measurements/a11y-devtools.md` (setup paragraph and findings bullets); tables unchanged. Each repaired claim re-checked against the tables/raw medians: CPU range 1.93-6.17x, scroll bytes/heap exceptions, latency vsync-step note, dropped repetition stated per log. Residual note (non-blocking): (c)'s sub-millisecond latencies on the list scrolls and `text-typing` are not covered by the 4/8 ms step explanation.",
